{
  "name": "AI Media v2 - Google Sheets Sync",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Google Sheets operations ledger\n\nPulls a normalized metadata snapshot from the authenticated video-worker every 15 minutes and upserts the native Google Sheet. Large media stays in /data.\n\nSelect a Google Sheets OAuth2 credential on all six sheet nodes before activation.",
